<title>UK: Devro &quot;satisfied&quot; with profit progress.</title>
<headline>Devro &quot;satisfied&quot; with profit progress.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scottish-based sausage skin maker Devro Plc said on Thursday that it was satisfied with its profit progress after the first four months of the year.</p>
<p>The company told shareholders at its annual meeting that many of the positive trends seen late last year have continued into 1997.</p>
<p>By 1122 GMT, shares in the company had risen 6p to stand at 308-1/2p.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
